//
// @file zigbee.rho
// @brief Zigbee coordinators and devices as rules: topic levels, placement, serial ports, the Zigbee2MQTT configuration Mesh owns, and what the bridge says.
//
// @module mesh.domain.zigbee
// @project mesh
// @author Aurel Miron
// @date 2026-11-20
